--- !u!114 &522489823
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 522489821}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 
  _lines:
  - Oh, you are awake. Do not thank me, and do not bother checking your pulse. There
    is not one.
  - You are [amber]dead[/amber]. That part is finished, settled, filed. What you
    are now is a guest. My guest.
  - And you reek of a good night. A judge, no less, arriving like this. I would laugh,
    but you will want me paying attention. There. Laughed anyway. Moving on.
  - Here is the whole of it. I have a few questions. A little game. What I am, why
    you are here, what waits at the end of it, none of that is yours to know. You
    choose. I keep score.
  - You spent a lifetime handing down what everyone else deserved. Turnabout is such
    a pretty word, is it not.
  _clickLockout: 0.3
  _clearAtEnd: 0
