  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 
  _lines:
  - Not so tidy now, was it. You had to guess what a life was worth, on my word,
    and my word is worth precisely nothing. That is rather the point.
  - Enough of trolleys. Let us try you without the rails. A room, two buttons, and
    one soul that has just become your problem. Come along.
  _clickLockout: 0.3
  _clearAtEnd: 0
